# 12. Security

Do NOT expose Django development tools publicly.

The public tunnel must not expose:

```text
.env
database files
private files
Django debug pages
Python source files
cloudflared credentials
```

Production configuration must use:

```env
DEBUG=False
```

Do not expose Django's debug error pages through the public tunnel.

If DEBUG is required for local development, use separate environment configuration.

---

# 13. HTTPS

The public URL must be HTTPS:

```text
https://api.example.com
```

Do not configure the application to require the user to access:

```text
http://api.example.com
```

Cloudflare should terminate the public HTTPS connection and securely tunnel the request to the local Django service.

