# 20. Important Operational Requirement

The system must understand that:

### Local operation

Does NOT require the internet.

```text
Phone → Wi-Fi → Django
```

### Remote operation

Requires internet.

```text
Phone → Internet → Cloudflare → Laptop
```

If the restaurant internet fails:

```text
Remote access = unavailable
Local restaurant operation = continues
```

Do not modify the local system in a way that makes restaurant operations dependent on Cloudflare or the internet.

